description	"Jedi Weapon Master

2-life Saber Focused Warrior Jedi with customizable Force Powers and Lightsaber attributes.

^2Weaponry: 
- Melee
- Short Lightsaber
-- Dual Sabers (Blue & Green)
-- Single Saber (Blue)
-- Saber Throw ^3[CS1]

^8Attributes:
- Reinforcement (1)
- Force Focus (2)
- Assemble (1)
- Jedi Conditioning (Environmental Protection 1)
- Inner Fortitude (Blast Armor)
- Light Resilience (Healing 1)
- 5% Less Knockback Taken"